  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CAFOD Nigeria 2024 Staff Away Day</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CAFOD Nigeria has planned to organize a staff away day to help colleagues encourage team bonding and collaboration while improving communication and problem-solving skills.
This activity will provide a relaxing and enjoyable break from work that contributes to boosting staff morale and motivation.
This would also serve as an avenue for the Head of Region-Africa who has been in Nigeria supporting the country program to meet with all Nigeria staff and new staff that would be joining the country program.</narrative>
  </description>
